{
  "_help": [
    "Clothing: one source skin per outfit. Every pixel is put into a garment (piece) and a colour field (slot: main, decor_1, decor_2, or fixed = never tinted)",
    "by the outfit rules: checked in order, the first matching \"when\" (or \"colors\") decides; \"default\" takes the rest.",
    "The generator writes textures/character/clothing/<gender>/<outfit>/<slim|classic>/<piece>/ and appearance/clothing.json.",
    "descriptions: what each colour field of a garment covers; without one the garment name is used.",
    "palettes: the colours offered per field; an outfit can override them per \"piece/slot\".",
    "Formulas: r g b lum h s v x y row group face surface; max() min() abs(); + - * / > >= < <= == != ! && || ( ) and 'text'."
